      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَشَارٌ</span></b>  <i>A</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">خَلِيَّة</span> [or <i>habitation of bees,</i> generally
<i>a hollow in a rock,</i>] (S, K,) <i>from which one
gathers,</i> or <i>extracts, honey;</i> (S;) <i>a bee-hive;</i> as
also ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُشْتَارٌ</span></b> . (KL.) See the next paragraph.
[And see also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مِشْوَارَةٌ</span>.]

